  "title": "Parquet Snapshots of the FishBase Database",
  "description": "Versioned parquet and CSV snapshots of the FishBase and SeaLifeBase MySQL backend databases, exported roughly annually and curated for programmatic access via the rOpenSci rfishbase package. The dataset comprises dozens of raw relational tables covering fish and marine species biology, taxonomy, ecology, abundance, and fisheries statistics. Data structure reflects the original MySQL schema and may require multi-table joins for common queries.",
